    <string name="setup_intro_title">Bring a new radio onto your Wi-Fi</string>
    <string name="setup_intro_1">A new or factory-reset radio starts in setup mode and opens its own Wi-Fi, usually “Setup &lt;Brand&gt; &lt;Model&gt; …”.</string>
    <string name="setup_intro_2">If the radio is already set up, start setup mode on the radio under Settings › Network › Network wizard or “Clear network settings” (depending on the device also “Set up with UNDOK” / “Setup via app”).</string>
    <string name="setup_intro_3">Have your Wi-Fi password ready.</string>
